    "about": "Tangible tokenizes real-world assets (real estate, gold and other goods) as TNFTs that can be traded on its marketplace and redeemed for the physical item. It also offers USTB, a rebasing stablecoin wrapping Mountain Protocol's USDM, and Baskets that bundle real-estate TNFTs into fungible ERC-20s. A governance and revenue-share token system (RWA/veRWA) runs on the re.al chain."
